e non-breaking space or just nothing. The safest rendering: a blank message with perhaps just a space. I'll choose to output essentially nothing—maybe just a single blank."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":408,"total_tokens":531,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":393},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}